1
00:00:00,218 --> 00:00:02,888
(Sheldon:)...you expect me to plunk down
thousands of dollars.

2
00:00:03,096 --> 00:00:05,806
(Assistant:)Actually, that's only 750.
Everything's on sale.

3
00:00:06,016 --> 00:00:08,146
Really? Talk to me
about that pocket watch.

4
00:00:12,522 --> 00:00:15,022
(Howard:)I'm still trying to wrap
my mind around it.

5
00:00:15,191 --> 00:00:18,651
(Howard:)I always thought
I'd be a dad someday.

6
00:00:18,862 --> 00:00:21,322
(Raj:)Me too. You're so caring.

7
00:00:21,489 --> 00:00:24,529
(Raj:)I've often pictured you guiding
a young boy into manhood.

8
00:00:29,539 --> 00:00:33,669
(Leonard:)There you go, Howard. Sounds like Raj'll
have your babies. Problem solved.

9
00:00:33,877 --> 00:00:36,047
(Raj:)Because a man
shows caring for another man...

10
00:00:36,212 --> 00:00:39,882
(Raj:)...doesn't mean he's displaying the love
that dare not speak its name.

11
00:00:42,427 --> 00:00:44,097
Did she say she didn't want kids?

12
00:00:44,304 --> 00:00:46,344
(Howard:)Yeah. She doesn't like them.

13
00:00:46,514 --> 00:00:49,224
(Howard:)And from what I saw,
the feeling was mutual.

14
00:00:55,106 --> 00:00:57,196
- What are you gonna do?
- I don't know.

15
00:00:57,359 --> 00:01:01,569
(Howard:)I can't see a life where I don't have kids.
I mean, people have kids.

